{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV配對綜藝節目《直樂VIURIETY The Choose Day 2.0》於11月10日迎來最終表白 …</p><p></p>\n<p>ViuTV配對綜藝節目《直樂VIURIETY The Choose Day 2.0》於11月10日迎來最終表白日，多位參賽者之間錯綜複雜感情線推向極致。原本大熱配對組合突然生變，女方當面劃清界線堅拒成為男方感情退路。這場充滿計算與真心的愛情角力最終誕生出令人跌破眼鏡震撼結局。</p>\n<h2>《直樂VIURIETY》表白日爆發激烈衝突</h2>\n<p>節目去到最後階段，各人互動變得極具火藥味與戲劇性。Kenneth與丁丁之間產生強烈化學反應，女方更公開坦承對方是全場最令她感興趣參賽者，瞬間推高現場曖昧氣氛。另一邊廂，翊行因為早前發動過於猛烈攻勢，反而令心儀對象宇夫承受巨大心理壓力而選擇退縮逃避，翊行試圖力挽狂瀾相約對方觀看日出，令現場氣氛變得相當緊繃。</p>\n<h2>Angel狠拒Howard拒絕擔當安全牌</h2>\n<p>處於多角關係漩渦中心的Howard陷入嚴重選擇困難，同時對當初心動對象宇夫及日久生情對象Angel產生好感。面對男方搖擺不定，Angel毫不猶豫作出強硬反擊，直接向對方攤牌表達立場：「如果我唔係你嘅第一選擇，咁你之後唔好再揀我，因為我嚟呢個節目唔係做人哋嘅安全牌！」這番斬釘截鐵言論瞬間將兩人關係推向冰點。</p>\n<h2>回顧Howard越野車浪漫約會倍添無奈</h2>\n<p>早於11月3日播出一集，Howard與Angel感情一度極速升溫，雙方共同參與刺激越野車約會。當時男方表現得極為主動進擊，更出言試探：「如果快嘅時候我係咪可以攬住你？」隨後順勢擁抱女方，兩人甜蜜互動一度獲全場看好。然而這份短暫甜蜜最終敵不過男方三心兩意，令這段原本備受期待感情線迎來極大反差。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議《直樂VIURIETY》最終配對</h2>\n<p>節目走向引發各大社交平台激烈討論，大批觀眾對女方果斷斬纜舉動拍手叫好。有網民留言大讚：「Angel簡直係人間清醒，絕對唔可以委屈自己做後備！」同時亦有部分聲音對男方優柔寡斷表現感到不滿，直指其貪心心態最終只會兩頭不到岸。公眾紛紛聚焦於最終表白成功幸運兒身份，對這場愛情修羅場最終賽果充滿無限想像。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430814646330157_4851712536af2f8338141c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁更指Kenneth是節目中令她最感興趣的參賽者，一眾參賽者都忍不住起哄！.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430814646330157_4851712536af2f8338141c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>丁丁更指Kenneth是節目中令她最感興趣的參賽者，一眾參賽者都忍不住起哄！（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430814943236725_7830145406af2f8362680f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 Chuck 與 Muji.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430814943236725_7830145406af2f8362680f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 Chuck 與 Muji（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430815251929542_19618572186af2f8393b925.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Angel之後更對Howard說：「如果我唔係你嘅第一選擇，咁你之後唔好再揀我，因為我嚟呢個節目唔係做人哋嘅安全牌！」.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430815251929542_19618572186af2f8393b925.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Angel之後更對Howard說：「如果我唔係你嘅第一選擇，咁你之後唔好再揀我，因為我嚟呢個節目唔係做人哋嘅安全牌！」（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430815577422686_6442848826af2f83c2fac1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Howard最終於越野車與Angel約會，二人都對這類刺激活動感到超興奮。_.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430815577422686_6442848826af2f83c2fac1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Howard最終於越野車與Angel約會，二人都對這類刺激活動感到超興奮。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430815813731277_12260405056af2f83e815ae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"眾參賽者在最終表白日前舉行聚餐。.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430815813731277_12260405056af2f83e815ae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>眾參賽者在最終表白日前舉行聚餐。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943081598798423_17018157326af2f8403f395.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 Howard.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943081598798423_17018157326af2f8403f395.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 Howard（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430816210344421_18860358486af2f8428ed86.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 丁丁.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430816210344421_18860358486af2f8428ed86.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 丁丁（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430816422094294_3345112026af2f844acbae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 宇夫.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430816422094294_3345112026af2f844acbae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 宇夫（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943081659648547_1958632026af2f8466622c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 翊行.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943081659648547_1958632026af2f8466622c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 翊行（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430816802595376_16934117236af2f8487a3d8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 Angel.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430816802595376_16934117236af2f8487a3d8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 Angel（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%88%80%e6%84%9b%e7%b6%9c%e8%97%9d/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">戀愛綜藝</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9c%80%e7%b5%82%e8%a1%a8%e7%99%bd%e6%97%a5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">最終表白日</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%9b%b4%e6%a8%82viuriety/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">直樂VIURIETY</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3539824\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 10 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T14:01:47.037377+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1550,"images":10,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T12:00:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:35:32.802583+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T13:55:10.084257+00:00","content_hash":"e966c1f290aa04683ca21b1e019e5353172ddc847b3e80cbfc5cbeb396245a7a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}